---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4" style="color: var(--logo-primary)">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--nav-text)">
        Last updated: June 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-xl" style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--logo-primary)">1. Data Collection</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--nav-text)">
          RealSalaryCheck operates as a privacy-first web utility. The financial inputs, income statistics, and country configurations entered into our comparison calculators are computed entirely locally inside your browser context. We do not transmit, collect, or store any proprietary financial credentials or specific income data on our infrastructure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--logo-primary)">2. Analytics and Analytics Signals</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--nav-text)">
          We utilize standard web analytics infrastructure to monitor generalized traffic patterns, regional usage distributions, and general system load parameters. This metadata involves non-personally identifiable variables such as device profiles, routing locations, and anonymized referral links used strictly to optimize site performance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--logo-primary)">3. Third-Party Advertisements</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--nav-text)">
          This utility serves programmatic advertisements managed via third-party advertising partners like Google AdSense. Ad delivery networks may parse basic, non-identifiable browser cookies to match relevant promotional content to users based on generic contextual interests.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--logo-primary)">4. Policy Amendments</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--nav-text)">
          We reserve the right to modify this privacy protocol at any time to preserve alignment with regulatory compliance baselines. Continued iteration with the site implicitly establishes full consent regarding our operational policies.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>